info_pages = PackedStringArray("TimeLife Corporation — Company Profile & Interview Briefing\n\nDear Mr. Ryan,\n\nThank you for your interest in TimeLife Corporation and for taking the time to participate in our recent interview process.", "After careful consideration, we regret to inform you that we have decided not to move forward with your application for the current position.\n\nWe were impressed by your educational background, communication skills, and willingness to learn.\n\nHowever, due to the high number of qualified applicants and the current requirements of this position, we have chosen candidates whose previous work experience more closely matches our operational needs.")
